#### Caso de Éxito: Crear pedido con cliente activo (CUST-01)
POST http://localhost:9064/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-01",
  "item": {
    "sku": "PRO-001",
    "quantity": 1,
    "price": 150.00
  }
}

### 2. Error 400: Stock Insuficiente (Intentar pedir 15 unidades superando el stock)
POST http://localhost:9064/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-01",
  "item": {
    "sku": "PROD-001",
    "quantity": 15,
    "price": 70.00
  }
}

### 3. Error 404: SKU Inexistente en el inventario
POST http://localhost:9064/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-01",
  "item": {
    "sku": "PROD-002",
    "quantity": 4,
    "price": 50.00
  }
}

### 4. Consultar pedidos registrados (GET)
GET http://localhost:9064/api/orders

### 5. Error 404: Intentar confirmar un pedido que no existe (ID 999)
POST http://localhost:9064/api/orders/55/confirm

### 6. Eliminar un pedido por ID (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:9064/api/orders/2

### 3. Caso de Error: Cliente Bloqueado (Debe retornar HTTP 400)
POST http://localhost:9064/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-02",
  "item": {
    "sku": "PRO-001",
    "quantity": 1,
    "price": 150.00
  }
}


